    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Sukfaristo, a suika game where the goal is to extract juice from charming little animals by combining them.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Combine two identical animals to create larger creatures.<br></li><li> Enjoy physics-based gameplay.<br></li><li> Immerse yourself in a fluid simulation with individual densities for each animal.<br></li><li> Skillfully control the fluid level to optimize your extractions.<br></li><li> Earn point multipliers based on the juice level, rewarding your risk-taking.<br></li><li> Keep your options open by putting an animal in reserve for later use.<br></li><li> Take on more intense challenges with the &quot;grandmaster&quot; mode.<br></li><li> Showcase your skills by unlocking stimulating achievements.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Sukfaristo, a suika game where the goal is to extract juice from charming little animals by combining them.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Combine two identical animals to create larger creatures.<br></li><li> Enjoy physics-based gameplay.<br></li><li> Immerse yourself in a fluid simulation with individual densities for each animal.<br></li><li> Skillfully control the fluid level to optimize your extractions.<br></li><li> Earn point multipliers based on the juice level, rewarding your risk-taking.<br></li><li> Keep your options open by putting an animal in reserve for later use.<br></li><li> Take on more intense challenges with the &quot;grandmaster&quot; mode.<br></li><li> Showcase your skills by unlocking stimulating achievements.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover Sukfaristo, a captivating puzzle game where you combine animals to harvest their precious juice. With unique physics-based gameplay and stimulating challenges, dive into a cute and addictive adventure!",
